  "text": "Emergency Vet & Animal Hospital | Red Bank Veterinary Hospital - Tinton Falls\nSkip to Primary Content\nOrder Food & Medicine\nReferral Portal\nReferral Portal\nMap\n100 Schulz Drive,\nRed Bank,\nNJ,\n07701\nCall\n(732) 747-3636\n24/7 Emergency & Critical Care\n24/7 Emergency & Critical Care\nPhone:\n(732) 747-3636\nAddress:\n100 Schulz Drive,\nRed Bank,\nNJ,\n07701\nCareers\nVirtual Tour\nBlog\nAbout Us\nOur Story\nOur Team\nServices\n24/7 Emergency & Critical Care\nAcupuncture\nAnesthesiology & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nBlood Bank\nCardiology\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDiagnostic Imaging\nGeneral Practice\nHemodialysis\nI-131\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology & Endoscopy\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nMedical Oncology\nRadiation Oncology\nOphthalmology\nPhysical Rehabilitation & Pain Management\nSurgery\nView all Services\nPet Owners\nPet Owner Resources\nIf Your Pet is Hospitalized\nPharmacy & Refills\nPet Loss Support\nVeterinarians\nReferral Support\nContinuing Education\nClinical Studies\nContact Us\nOrder Food & Medicine\n24/7 Emergency & Critical Care\nReferral Portal\nNow Offering Virtual Urgent Care!\nAvailable 8AM - 4:30PM, daily!\nClick the chat widget below to schedule a virtual care consult today!\nLearn More\nWelcome to Red Bank Veterinary Hospital\nContact Us\nNow Available - PET/CT Imaging\nFor early pet cancer detection\nLearn More\nNow Offering Virtual Urgent Care!\nAvailable 8AM - 4:30PM, daily!\nClick the chat widget below to schedule a virtual care consult today!\nLearn More\nWelcome to Red Bank Veterinary Hospital\nContact Us\nNow Available - PET/CT Imaging\nFor early pet cancer detection\nLearn More\nNow Offering Virtual Urgent Care!\nAvailable 8AM - 4:30PM, daily!\nClick the chat widget below to schedule a virtual care consult today!\nLearn More\nWelcome to Red Bank Veterinary Hospital!\nProviding emergency & specialty care to Monmouth County and Central New Jersey since 1986.\nRed Bank Veterinary Hospital is a 24-hour emergency and critical care facility serving Red Bank, Tinton Falls, Freehold, Middletown, Toms River, and Monmouth County.\nCareers\nJoin Our Team\nPet Owners\nIf Your Pet is Hospitalized\nServices\nView all Services\nCareers\nJoin Our Team\nPet Owners\nIf Your Pet is Hospitalized\nServices\nView all Services\nCareers\nJoin Our Team\nPet Owners\nIf Your Pet is Hospitalized\nServices\nView all Services\nCareers\nJoin Our Team\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(732) 747-3636\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nVECCS Level II Certified Facility\nRed Bank Veterinary Hospital receives certification as a Level II Veterinary Emergency & Critical Care facility. The Veterinary Emergency and Critical Care Society (VECCS) is now offering a certification program to veterinary facilities that provide emergency and critical patient care. The purpose of this certification is to recognize those hospitals that meet and exceed the minimum standards and guidelines published by VECCS. VECCS does this in the hopes of raising the standard of care while also increasing public and professional awareness in the area of veterinary emergency and critical patient care.\nThis certification program identifies three levels (I through III) based on facility operating hours, equipment and personnel. The VECCS has identified a Level II facility as such: “The Level II emergency and critical care facility is a 24-hour acute care facility with the medical staff, personnel and training necessary to provide emergent and critical patient care. This facility is open to receive small animal emergency patients 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, 365 days a year.”\nClient Reviews & Testimonials\nWe value our clients' experience at Red Bank Veterinary Hospital - Tinton Falls. Here is a small sample of the hundreds of happy pets that we have cared for since 1986.\nBe In The Know!\nJoin Our Newsletter to stay up to date with what’s going on in our hospital!\nVeterinarians\nPet Owners\nAccessibility\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nCareers\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
